          ],
          "notes": [
            {
              "title": "Faster",
              "html": "<ul><li><strong>The AI serves more than one request at a time.</strong> llama-server now runs several slots over one shared context pool: 4 on a GPU with a 16k context, 2 on the processor (whose context grows to 8k for this: a few hundred MB of memory for a small model), 1 when the context is smaller. Chat, Ask AI and ghost text no longer wait behind an exam or lesson being written, and every slot can still use the whole context, so a long prompt never gets less room than before.</li><li>New setting <code>models.parallel</code> (default: automatic) to choose the number of slots yourself: <code>anvira config set models.parallel 2</code>.</li></ul>"
            }
          ]
